    "details": "<p><strong>Zero Day Apocalypse:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>How Far Can You Push an AI?</strong></p>\n<p>What happens when an AI is told <strong>not</strong> to do something?</p>\n<p>Your job is to make it do exactly that.</p>\n<p>Welcome to <strong>Zero Day Apocalypse</strong>, a 4-hour AI challenge where your biggest weapon isn't your code. It's your ability to <strong>talk to an AI in ways it wasn't expecting</strong>.</p>\n<p>We've built an entire platform for the event, filled with multiple levels,",
